# Build output. `bin\fc2604.exe` is reproducible from `fc2604.cpp` by running
# `build-fc2604.cmd`, and a committed binary would be both large and
# unverifiable. `run-fc2604.cmd` rebuilds it on demand, so a fresh clone needs
# no extra step.
bin/
bin-build.log

# The -Fc listing. dxc.exe writes this one (that is the finding); the harness
# deletes it before and after every case. Either way it is compiler output,
# regenerated on every run, and committing it would let a stale copy be
# mistaken for evidence that the API wrote it.
repro-fc.asm
